%% Title: One RFQ end to end, with the timings the contract pins
sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Client
  participant V as D2C venue
  participant G as VenueGateway and FixSession
  participant L as EventLoop
  participant J as Inbound and outbound journals
  participant Q as QuotingEngine
  participant R as RiskEngine
  participant H as Hedger
  participant S as SmartOrderRouter
  participant P as PositionKeeper

  C->>V: RFQ to 3 to 5 dealers
  Note over V: dealer response window 5000 ms (Section 11.3)
  V->>G: FIX QuoteRequest R
  G->>L: SBE QuoteRequest (10) on the inbound ring
  L->>J: append inbound frame at the latched cycle time
  L->>Q: dispatch through QuotingEventHandler
  Note over Q: inputs no older than 2 s, heartbeats within 3 s, re-quote throttle 250 ms (Section 12.1)
  Q->>R: checkQuote, 11 checks in order (Section 13.2)
  R-->>Q: accepted, quantity reserved
  Q->>L: publish Quote (11), FIRM until now + 5 s or the request expiry, whichever is first
  L->>J: append outbound frame
  Note over L,J: decode to encode target: p50 under 20 us, p99.9 under 100 us (BENCHMARKS.md)
  L->>G: outbound ring
  G->>V: FIX Quote S
  V->>C: every quote when the window closes or all dealers answered
  C->>V: trade with the best quote
  V->>G: FIX QuoteResponse AJ Done, cover price
  G->>L: SBE QuoteResponse (12)
  L->>J: append inbound frame
  L->>Q: dispatch
  Q->>R: onFill, release the reservation
  Note over Q: markout measured 60 s after the fill (markoutHorizonNanos)
  Note over Q: an unanswered quote expires at validUntilNanos and frees its reservation
  H->>R: on each timer: residual ladder
  Note over H: first tranche 0.5 of the plan, then half-life 30 s (Section 14.2)
  H->>S: parent order through HedgeOrderSink, bound at integration
  Note over S: slices over at most 120 s, passive for at most 30 s, then aggressive (Section 15.1)
  S->>L: NewOrder (20) to the chosen venue
  L->>J: append outbound frame
  J->>P: journal frames booked by PositionKeeper (Section 17.2)
